{
  "key": 25643,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "MiningMuseum_Text_WelcomeToMuseum",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello! Welcome to the Oreburgh\n",
        "Mining Museum!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Bonjour! Bienvenue au Musée Minier de\n",
        "Charbourg!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "MiningMuseum_Text_FossilResearcherGreeting",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello, hello!\n",
        "How are you?\r",
        "I study Pokémon Fossils!\n",
        "Me! Right here and now!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Bonjour, bonjour!\r",
        "Je suis un scientifique très\n",
        "sérieux!\r",
        "J’étudie les Fossiles anciens\n",
        "de Pokémon!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "MiningMuseum_Text_ShallIReviveFossil",
      "en_US": [
        "You have a Fossil for me, yes?\n",
        "Shall I turn it into a Pokémon?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Vous n’auriez pas un Fossile pour moi?\n",
        "Je le transforme en Pokémon, oui?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "MiningMuseum_Text_ReviveWhichFossil",
      "en_US": [
        "Which Fossil should I turn back\n",
        "into a Pokémon? Choose! Now!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Quel Fossile dois-je transformer en\n",
        "Pokémon? Choisis! Vite!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "MiningMuseum_Text_WillReviveFossil",
      "en_US": [
        "OK, I will do that! Turn that Fossil\n",
        "back into a Pokémon, surely I will!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "OK, je vais faire ça! Transformer ce\n",
        "Fossile en Pokémon, oui!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "MiningMuseum_Text_DeclinedFossilRevival",
      "en_US": [
        "You don’t wish that I extract any\n",
        "Pokémon from a Fossil. Fine, then!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Vous ne voulez pas que je transforme de\n",
        "Fossile en Pokémon. Bah, bien!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "MiningMuseum_Text_ExtractingPokemonLeave",
      "en_US": [
        "I am in the process of extracting\n",
        "your Pokémon from a Fossil.\r",
        "You go outside, yes, please. Now!\n",
        "Time alone is what I now need. NOW!!!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Je suis en train de transformer votre\n",
        "Fossile en Pokémon.\r",
        "Vous sortez, oui, s’il vous plaît. Vite!\n",
        "Je n’ai besoin que de temps. VITE!!!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "MiningMuseum_Text_ThisIsRevivedPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "You were gone too long!\n",
        "You kept us waiting! Unacceptable!\r",
        "This is your {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}!\n",
        "You be good to it, OK!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Vous revoici! Votre Fossile a été\n",
        "transformé!\r",
        "C’est un {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}!\n",
        "Vous serez aimable avec lui, hein?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "MiningMuseum_Text_ReceivedPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received\n",
        "the {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} obtient un\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "MiningMuseum_Text_GiveNickname",
      "en_US": [
        "Give a nickname to the {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}\n",
        "you received?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Donner un surnom au Pokémon\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "MiningMuseum_Text_PartyFull",
      "en_US": [
        "But, no, I cannot do this!\n",
        "You have too many Pokémon with you!\r",
        "I must hold it for you, so come back,\n",
        "you, and take it away, please."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Mais... Non, je ne peux pas faire ça!\n",
        "Vous avez trop de Pokémon avec vous!\r",
        "Je dois le garder pour vous, alors vous\n",
        "revenez plus tard et vous l’emmenez,\f",
        "oui."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "MiningMuseum_Text_BringFossilsToMe",
      "en_US": [
        "If it is a Fossil that you obtain,\n",
        "bring it to me if you must."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Si vous obtenez un Fossile,\n",
        "amenez-le-moi si vous y tenez."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "MiningMuseum_Text_NotYetReady",
      "en_US": [
        "On the verge of a breakthrough, I am,\n",
        "to achieve extraction from Fossils.\r",
        "From Fossils I can extract Pokémon,\n",
        "but not yet, not yet."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Sur le point de faire une découverte,\n",
        "je dois réussir l’extraction de\f",
        "Fossiles.\r",
        "Des Fossiles, je dois extraire des\n",
        "Pokémon, mais pas encore, pas encore."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "MiningMuseum_Text_CoalExhibit1",
      "en_US": [
        "Whoa! So this is coal?\n",
        "I never expected something this big!\r",
        "And that color!\n",
        "It really is as black as they say!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Waouh! Alors c’est ça, le charbon?\n",
        "Je ne pensais pas que c’était si gros!\r",
        "Et cette couleur!\n",
        "C’est vraiment aussi noir qu’on le dit!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "MiningMuseum_Text_CoalExhibit2",
      "en_US": [
        "Wow! The Pokémon that carried this\n",
        "must be terribly strong!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Waouh! Les Pokémon qui transportent\n",
        "ça doivent être très forts!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "MiningMuseum_Text_MineExtendsUnderSea",
      "en_US": [
        "Well, how about that!\r",
        "The Oreburgh Mine extends under\n",
        "the seafloor!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Eh bien, ça, c’est quelque chose!\r",
        "La Mine de Charbourg s’étend\n",
        "sous la mer!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "MiningMuseum_Text_UndergroundManInfo",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s a little far from here, but there\n",
        "is a city called Eterna City.\r",
        "I’ve heard a curious person named the\n",
        "Underground Man lives there.\r",
        "With a name like that, he must be an\n",
        "authority on the Underground."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Loin d’ici, il y a une ville du nom de\n",
        "Vestigion.\r",
        "Il paraît qu’un personnage étrange y\n",
        "vit, l’Homme du Souterrain.\r",
        "Avec un tel nom, ce doit être un expert\n",
        "du Souterrain."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "MiningMuseum_Text_MiningRequiresStrongMind",
      "en_US": [
        "Mining must take a strong mind, not\n",
        "just a tough body.\r",
        "Think about it. You’re in darkness,\n",
        "digging desperately through rock."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Pour travailler dans la mine, le mental\n",
        "compte autant que les muscles.\r",
        "Penses-y. Tout le temps dans le noir,\n",
        "à creuser la roche..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "MiningMuseum_Text_MineHistory",
      "en_US": [
        "The history of Oreburgh Mine...\r",
        "You could call it a history of effort and\n",
        "friendship between people and Pokémon."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "L’histoire de la Mine de Charbourg...\r",
        "Elle est marquée par le travail et la\n",
        "collaboration entre les gens et\f",
        "les Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "MiningMuseum_Text_HowCoalIsMade1",
      "en_US": [
        "How Coal Is Made   1\r",
        "“In a time long before history,\n",
        "vegetative matter was swept along\r",
        "by rain and rivers. It came to be\n",
        "buried under the ground.”"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Comment s’est formé le Charbon   1\r",
        "“Il y a très longtemps, les matières\n",
        "végétales furent entraînées par les\r",
        "pluies et les rivières. Elles ont été\n",
        "enfouies sous le sol.”"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "MiningMuseum_Text_HowCoalIsMade2",
      "en_US": [
        "How Coal Is Made   2\r",
        "“The buried plant matter was\n",
        "forced ever deeper under the ground\r",
        "due to tremors and fissures caused\n",
        "by the shifting landmasses.”"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Comment s’est formé le Charbon   2\r",
        "“La matière ensevelie s’est enfoncée\n",
        "encore plus profondément à cause des\r",
        "secousses et des fissures dues aux\n",
        "glissements de terrain.”"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "MiningMuseum_Text_HowCoalIsMade3",
      "en_US": [
        "How Coal Is Made   3\r",
        "“Deep under the ground, the\n",
        "plant matter was subjected to heavy\r",
        "pressure and the heat of magma.\n",
        "It gradually turned into coal.”"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Comment s’est formé le Charbon   3\r",
        "“Dans le sol, la matière végétale\n",
        "a subi de fortes pressions et la chaleur\r",
        "du magma. Elle s’est peu à peu\n",
        "transformée en charbon.”"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "MiningMuseum_Text_SamplesDifferentRegions",
      "en_US": [
        "Samples of coal from different regions\n",
        "are displayed."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Des échantillons de charbon de\n",
        "différentes régions sont exposés ici."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "MiningMuseum_Text_CategorizedCoalSamples",
      "en_US": [
        "The box contains categorized samples\n",
        "of coal."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Cette vitrine d’exposition contient des\n",
        "échantillons classés de charbon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "MiningMuseum_Text_MiningLamps",
      "en_US": [
        "Different kinds of lamps are\n",
        "displayed.\r",
        "They appear to have been worn\n",
        "on someone’s head while underground."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Différents types de lampes sont\n",
        "exposés.\r",
        "Des gens les ont portées sur leur\n",
        "tête dans la mine."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "MiningMuseum_Text_MiningTools",
      "en_US": [
        "Badly scarred wooden tools are\n",
        "displayed.\r",
        "They apparently dug out coal using\n",
        "these tools in the olden days."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Des objets en bois très abîmés sont\n",
        "exposés ici.\r",
        "Ils ont apparemment servi à extraire le\n",
        "charbon du sol il y a longtemps."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "MiningMuseum_Text_MineWorkerItems",
      "en_US": [
        "The everyday items and tools of\n",
        "past mine workers are displayed."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Des objets et des outils usuels des\n",
        "anciens mineurs sont exposés ici."
      ]
    }
  ]
}